### 1. Search API
- **Endpoint:** `GET /api/discovery/search`
- **Params:** `q`, `category`, `min_sps`, `min_commission`, `network`.
- **Logic:**
    - Text search on title/description (Postgres Full Text Search or ILIKE).
    - Filter by columns.
    - Sort by SPS desc.
